# The image is a runtime, not a copy of the website.
#
# api.py, build.py, the templates and 166 MB of photographs all arrive at run
# time from the checkout bind-mounted at /app — they have to, because
# publishing means committing and pushing that checkout, so a copy baked into
# the image would be a second, diverging one. Only three things belong in the
# build context, so this is an allowlist rather than a list of exclusions.

*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!entrypoint.sh
!mariadmin

# Built inside the image, and both are large enough to double the context.
mariadmin/node_modules
mariadmin/dist
